I have been able to run nethack decently by using a os/2 v 1.3 (which
run on 286 machines) and the os/2 version of the game.  
You can boot os/2 from a diskette if you don't want to install it
on your HD.  Os/2 1.3 claims to need 4M memory, but you may
get away with less when you don't run a full installation with PM and such.

